## 6. Audience profile

**Who they are:** Web3 builders, AI developers, founders, students
entering tech, cybersecurity people. They're building or trying to break
into an industry that moves faster than any curriculum tracks.

**What they're anxious about:** Missing the shift. Not having the right
skills when the next wave hits. Working hard in the wrong direction.
Not knowing what the people ahead of them actually know.

**What they get wrong:** They consume news and updates without pulling
out the insight underneath. They see the surface of trends, not the
structural pattern driving them.

**What they need to hear but resist:** How hard they actually need to
work to stay ahead. The real state of the industry — not the optimistic
version, not the doomer version, the accurate one.

**When it lands:** People comment with their own take, ask real
questions, share it to other platforms and start discussions. The signal
is engagement with the idea, not passive likes.

